{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000770","compactId":"SO_0000770","id":"SO:0000770","label":"tmRNA_acceptor_piece","definition":{"text":"The acceptor region of a two-piece tmRNA that when mature is charged at its 3' end with alanine. The tmRNA gene undergoes circular permutation in some groups of bacteria; processing of the transcripts from such a gene leaves the mature tmRNA in two pieces, base-paired together.","xrefs":["Indiana:kw","doi:10.1093/nar/gkh795"]},"comments":["Added in response to Kelly Williams from Indiana. Date: Nov 2005."],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"tmRNA acceptor piece"}],"xrefs":[],"subsets":[],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0000770/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"}]},"parents":["SO:0000847"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0000847","SO:0000834","SO:0000833","SO:0001411","SO:0000001","SO:0000110"],"descendants":[],"relationships":[],"graphNeighborhood":{"parents":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000847"],"children":[],"related":[]}},"graph":{"parents":[{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000847","id":"SO:0000847","label":"tmRNA_region"}],"children":[],"related":[]}}